'''Princess Head''' (プリンセスカオル ''Purinsesu Kaoru'', '''Princess Kaoru''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[The Face]] that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.7 Update|Version 2.0.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Princess Head
|image = E 061.png
|first appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
Princess Head sports moderate health, damage, and movement speed. She is a slightly more threatening version of [[Shy Boy]]. Although she attacks slightly less often, she has one-fourth of his speed as well as an extra knockback. She also loses the exploitable [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] trait and has more health, range and damage. She normally comes with other enemies like [[Kerihime (form 1) (Enemy)|Kerihime]] and [[Yurinchi (Enemy)|Yurinchi]], but otherwise, she is fairly weak.

==Strategy==
Send out long-ranged [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]], but remember to back them up with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and other meatshields if necessary. Since this is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy with almost 50% lower range than the regular Face, cats such as [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]], [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] and [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Bishop Cat]] are useful for fighting her. If you have Awakened Bahamut Cat, he will be a great choice against her since he outranges Princess Head and can destroy her in a few hits.

